  "acceptance_notes": [
    "Do not post this envelope as /prompt. POST {prompt: workflows[mode].prompt, client_id: your_id} only after substituting placeholder strings and uploading references into this ComfyUI instance.",
    "LoadImage.image is the ComfyUI uploaded relative filename (including subfolder when returned), not an arbitrary local absolute path.",
    "Check /object_info class names and model filename enumerations on the installed pinned runtime before first submission; this file is a source-verified proposal, not a successful inference report.",
    "T2I uses native Qwen21 text node output2 instead of the optional empty-latent node; both reference conditionings share exact same image list and VAE.",
    "The edit graph contains true VAE reference conditioning. Removing vae to bypass artifacts changes the task to vision-conditioned generation and is not accepted as edit validation.",
    "Initial CPU fp32 VAE is a precaution for official issue16433 MPS VAE encode artifacts. Device flag also affects decoding.",
    "Issue16435 reports noise at edit resolution1024 including CPU, but992/1056 reportedly worked. This is an unresolved upstream report, not a confirmed local workaround; try992 as isolated diagnostic and visually validate.",
    "Native SaveImage writes PNG and preserves RGBA arrays. Returned output filename must exist and decode; a queue prompt_id alone is not success.",
    "For a faithful reference edit, inspect preservation of unedited subject/layout as well as requested alteration. Record timings and memory separately for T2I and edit."
